  "title": "In Scope",
  "summary": "Claire admits she saw Femi's name on the org chart on 29 Dec and spent six days deciding how to tell him. Dev, scared for his job, asks Femi what he knows; Femi knows nothing and sounds evasive anyway. When Femi asks Claire whether Dev is on a list, she refuses and warns she'd have to report a second ask. Then she lays out her choice: disclose and lose the project, or stay silent and lose him. She asks Femi to choose.",
  "status": "final",
  "cliffhanger": "Femi refuses to make Claire's choice for her: 'That one's yours.' She starts typing.",
